SSP2 <p>Dictionary of year-value pairs giving time dependent multiplication factor of the SSP2 MAC. Linear interpolation is taken in between keyframes. Used for time-dependent changes between SSPs.</p> <ul> <li> <p>Type: dict</p> </li> <li> <p>Default: {2020: 1}</p> </li> <li> <p>Can be false: False</p> </li> </ul> <p>Example usage: </p> <pre><code>params = load_params()
params["economics"]["MAC"]["SSP_calibration_factor"]["SSP2"] = {2020: 1}
model = MIMOSA(params)
</code></pre> SSP1 <p> </p> <p>Dictionary of year-value pairs giving time dependent multiplication factor of the SSP2 MAC. Linear interpolation is taken in between keyframes. Used for time-dependent changes between SSPs.</p> <ul> <li> <p>Type: dict</p> </li> <li> <p>Default: {2020: 1, 2100: 0.618}</p> </li> <li> <p>Can be false: False</p> </li> </ul> <p>Example usage: </p> <pre><code>params = load_params()
